      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "minimal-entry",
          "text": "对应版本的 `prd / user-story / test-case` 已冻结时，用户可以在 Codex / Claude 内通过 `beacon-implement + version + prompt` 直接进入实现前核实流程。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260423T100422Z-a96f",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-23T10:31:36.185602+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.7/user-story/beacon-v1.3.7-implement-frozen-truth-verification-and-canonical-delivery-baseline-envelope.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "prompt-boundary",
          "text": "系统能将 prompt 明确分类为 `in_scope_implementation`、`clarification_within_scope`、`requirement_change`、`truth_conflict`，并且只允许前两类继续。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260423T100422Z-a96f",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-23T10:31:36.185602+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.7/user-story/beacon-v1.3.7-implement-frozen-truth-verification-and-canonical-delivery-baseline-envelope.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "stop-and-reroute",
          "text": "当 prompt 被判定为 requirement 变更或 truth 冲突时，系统必须阻断 implement，并给出 requirement change / refreeze 路由。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260423T100422Z-a96f",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-23T10:31:36.185602+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.7/user-story/beacon-v1.3.7-implement-frozen-truth-verification-and-canonical-delivery-baseline-envelope.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "canonical-source",
          "text": "`implement plan` 必须先生成 canonical 的 `implementation delivery baseline envelope`，再投影 `architecture-blueprint`、deterministic contract、git workflow 与 implementation plan。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260423T100422Z-a96f",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-23T10:31:36.185602+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.7/user-story/beacon-v1.3.7-implement-frozen-truth-verification-and-canonical-delivery-baseline-envelope.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "consistency-gate",
          "text": "gate 必须以 canonical envelope 为唯一对齐源，对 `baseline_id`、事务元数据和 service/branch/worktree 关键信息做一致性校验；发现漂移必须阻断。",
